   "no": 3,
   "en": "DATA",
   "title": "你需要准备什么",
   "html": "<p>本地演示无需接入现场。下面的数据清单用于说明这一业务的资料要求，不表示项目已取得这些实测资料。</p><p>这个场景的数据几乎全部躺在现有手册和井史里，建设成本集中在<strong>结构化整理</strong>而非采集。最容易被忽略的是「口径统一」：不同厂家穿深测试用的靶件不同，数字入库前必须换算到同一标准，否则排序从根上就是错的。</p><div class='checklist'><div class='cl-head'><span>数据准备清单 · 3 项</span><span class='cl-prog'><span id='cl-txt'>0 / 3</span><span class='cl-bar'><i id='cl-fill'></i></span></span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='0'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>射孔弹参数库</span><span class='cl-s'>型号、穿深、孔径、适用套管，厂家手册结构化</span></span><span class='cl-n'>统一到同一标准靶件口径</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='1'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>井况参数</span><span class='cl-s'>岩性、套管钢级、壁厚、完井方式</span></span><span class='cl-n'>无需标注，自动从井数据库读取</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='2'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>使用反馈</span><span class='cl-s'>实弹效果评价：穿深复核、出砂、套管损伤</span></span><span class='cl-n'>少量标注，用于修正推荐权重</span></div></div>"
